  "review": {
    "gallery": "The official project page elevation retains both Flare towers in the card and main gallery. Eight native brochure images show the pools, building approach and interiors.",
    "location": "Physical page 8 depicts the site and wider JVT connections. The combined Ibn Battuta and Dubai Festival City timing is ambiguous and not used as an individual journey. Project-name directions serve both towers.",
    "floorPlans": "Forty published apartment types matched across the colour brochure and the extended original plan book. The paired drawings retain their shared headers and notices. Tower 01 three-bedroom Type 02 shows 179.39 m² in the brochure and 173.39 m² in the extended set with the same published 1,866.35 sq ft total. Seven schematic or engineering sheets show amenities, both ground and podium retail floors, and selected Tower 02 residential floors. Full original engineering sets are linked."
  },
  "unavailable": [
    "Exact entry pins for the two towers and current shop-by-shop dimensions were not established. The reviewed sources do not supply separate marketing sheets with total areas for Tower 02 three- and four-bedroom apartments."
  ]
}
